{"sourceUrl":"https://www.sysush.com/content/1e33ca76-de82-4c6e-880b-97f1b1213f27","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:14.758494+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.sysush.com/content/1e33ca76-de82-4c6e-880b-97f1b1213f27","html":"<div><div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font> 为促进全国高校优秀大学生之间的交流，拓展学术视野，增进优秀大学生对科学研究的认识，吸引更多的优秀人才加入中山大学附属第七医院（后文简称中山七院），中山七院拟于</font><font>202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>年</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>8</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>月</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>初</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>举办</font><font>202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>，</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>欢迎全国</font><font>202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>年优秀应届毕业生踊跃报名参加！</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>一、医院介绍</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font> 中山七院作为深圳市与中山大学</font><font>“市校战略合作”的结晶，是中山大学设置在深圳市的首家直属附属医院。医院规划总床位4000张。开业4年2个月创造全国新建医院最快通过三甲评审的纪录</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font> 医院的一期建设编制床位</font><font>800张，实际开放床位863张，于2018年5月11日正式开业。医院二期项目将于2025年投入使用，新增床位3200张。中山七院在中大医科实力雄厚的多家附属医院的支持下，平移优质医疗资源，引进27个国家临床重点专科团队。疑难危</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>重患者收治率最高超过</font><font>80%，危重患者抢救成功率超99%</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>已建立了覆盖本科生见习实习、硕士博士研究生培养、住院医师和进修生培训的完整教学体</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>系；医院拥有专职科研人员</font><font>225名；获批5个省、市级重点实验室或临床医学研究中心，落地2个诺贝尔奖实验室；获国家自然科学基金144项，保持深圳前列；荣登《2023中国医院创新转化100强》。2024年7月3日，何裕隆、张常华教授团队主导的肿瘤耐药机制研究突破性成果在《自然》杂志刊登。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font> 作为中大深圳校区主要教学基地-第七临床学院，中山七院秉承中山大学的办学理念，传承“三基三严三早”教学传统，遵循医学教育和人才成长规律，以岗位胜任力为导向，积极构建院校教育、毕业后教育、继续教育有机衔接的医学人才培养体系，打造名医摇篮和医学人才“蓄水池”。中山七院成立了28个教研室</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>，博士研究生导师</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>52</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>名，硕士研究生导师</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>200</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>名，中山七院从</font><font>2017年至今招收各类研究生</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>近千</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>名。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>二、报名条件</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  1. </font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>政治思想品德优秀，诚实守信，身体健康；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  2. </font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>具有临床医学、基础医学、生物学、医学技术等相关专业背景，对临床、科研工作具有浓厚兴趣；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  3. </font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>本科学习成绩优秀，具有较强动手能力和较好科研潜质，总成绩排名原则上在所读学校同年级本专业前</font><font>30%以内（在其他方面有突出表现的学生除外），</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>获得（或者可能获得）所在高校推荐免试生资格者优先；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  4. </font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>就读本科院校为全国著名高校或就读本科院校的学科为全国优势学科，且将于</font><font>202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>年</font><font>6月前毕业；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  5. </font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>具有良好听、说、读、写的英语应用能力。</font><font> </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>三、报名</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>材料与</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>方式</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font> 请于</font><font>202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>年</font><font>7月</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>21</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日</font><font>12:00前通过报名链接或者扫描二维码进行问卷报名:</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.wjx.cn/vm/QlVwbY9.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/QlVwbY9.aspx#</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"%E5%A4%8F%E4%BB%A4%E8%90%A5.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.sysush.com/sites/sysush1.live.sysucloud1.sysu.edu.cn/files/%E5%A4%8F%E4%BB%A4%E8%90%A5.png\"/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>        同时，请按顺序将以下材料（</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>1-7）</font></span><