an></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  4.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>《教育部学籍在线验证报告》，办理方式详见中国高等教育学生信息网</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>http://www.chsi.com.cn/xlcx/bgys.jsp</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  5.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>本科阶段成绩单、成绩总评排名的证明材料扫描件（加盖学校教务部门公章）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  6.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>英语水平的证明材料扫描件（大学英语四六级考试成绩、</font><font>TOEFL、IELTS、GRE成绩等体现英语水平的证明材料）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  7.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>其他证明材料，如代表性学术论文（首页即可</font><font>-即题目、摘要、作者所在页）、其他原创性工作成果、获奖证书等，学术论文以正式见刊为准。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>四、活动安排</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  1. 活动时间</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>：</font><font>2025年</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>8</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>月</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日</font><font>-</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>7</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  2. 活动方式：现场参加学术讲座与交流；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  3. 活动安排：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  5</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日（周二）上午：营员报到；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  5</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日（周二）下午：开营仪式，医院研究生教育情况介绍，参观医院临床科室和实验室；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日（周三）：参加医院</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>MDT，结束后</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>参加学术讲座，上午、下午各</font><font>2-3个专题；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  7</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日（周四）上午：师生交流；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>  7</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日（周四）下午：结营仪式。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>五</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>、其他说明</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>   1.本次夏令营计划招收</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>学员</font><font>50名，择优录取；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>   2.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>通过审核者将成为正式营员，入选名单将在医院官网进行公示，并将邀请符合条件的同学加入中大七院</font><font>202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>年夏令营微信群，后续相关通知将在群内发布。届时未接到入营通知的同学皆为未入选者，不另行通知。如因特殊情况不能参加本次夏令营</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>，请于</font><font>7月</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>25</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>日前及时与我们</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>联系。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>   3</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>我院将为学员提供在活动期间的免费食宿，同时提供往返中山七院的交通补助（补助标准按相关规定执行）。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>   4</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>活动结束后，我院将为符合条件的学员颁发结业证书。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>六</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>、联系方式</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font> 联系人：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>徐</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>老师，</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>张</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>老师</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><s